{"id":"rdd9","designation":"RDD 9","title":"MXF Interoperability Specification of Sony MPEG Long GOP Products","state":"active","suite":null,"official":{"family_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/doc/rdd9/","latest_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/latest/rdd9/","checked_at":"2026-11-11"},"scope":"This document specifies the mapping of MPEG-2 Picture (ES), AES3 audio and ANC packets into the MXF Generic Container. The MXF files created according to the details of this specification comply with the MXF specifications defined in the normative references, with a variation with respect to one new rule introduced in SMPTE ST 377-1. In conjunction with the referenced Standards, this RDD is intended to provide sufficient information to enable a developer to construct MXF files that will be compatible with Sony MPEG-2 Long GOP products.","outline":[{"level":1,"title":"1 Scope","page":3},{"level":1,"title":"2 Reference Documents","page":3},{"level":1,"title":"3 Introduction","page":3},{"level":1,"title":"4 Outline of MXF File Structure for this Mapping","page":4},{"level":1,"title":"5 MPEG Picture Data and AES3 Data Mapping","page":5},{"level":2,"title":"5.1 Frame Wrappings","page":5},{"level":2,"title":"5.2 System Item Mapping","page":6},{"level":3,"title":"5.2.1 Overview of System Item","page":6},{"level":3,"title":"5.2.2 System Metadata Pack","page":6},{"level":3,"title":"5.2.3 Package Metadata Set","page":7},{"level":3,"title":"5.2.4 Picture Metadata Set","page":7},{"level":2,"title":"5.3 Picture Item Mapping","page":7},{"level":3,"title":"5.3.1 MPEG Picture Element Key","page":8},{"level":4,"title":"5.3.1.1 MPEG Picture Element Number — Byte 16","page":8},{"level":3,"title":"5.3.2 MPEG Picture Element Length","page":8},{"level":3,"title":"5.3.3 MPEG Picture Element Value","page":8},{"level":2,"title":"5.4 AES3 Sound Item Mapping","page":9},{"level":3,"title":"5.4.1 AES3 Sound Element Key","page":9},{"level":4,"title":"5.4.1.1 AES3 Sound Element Count — Byte 14","page":10},{"level":4